  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="30.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 30.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Be ordale. ⁊ gyf hi ðonne að syllan ne durran, gange he to ðam ðrifealdan ordale.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Concerning the ordeal. If they dare not give the oath, he (the accused) shall go to the triple ordeal.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And gif heo þone að syllan ne durren, gange he to þam þryfealdan ordale.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
